The function is already branch-minimal; I only added `__builtin_expect` hints so the cached-type fast path is laid out inline and the error branches are cold, and reused a single `profile` null check.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if ( __builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 1) )
        return type;

    if ( __builtin_expect((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields), 0) )
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;
}
```